    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Zjawa</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cult has been spreading in one of the kingdoms, you were sent to purge it of corruption by orders of the Pope. You are to rid this place of darkness, and show no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zjawa: Bloodstained Soul is a Survival Horror RPG with a unique\u00a0Timed-Turn Combat System, traverse eerie woods, grim churches and desolate town, gather items and kill or avoid macabre creatures standing in your way. Death is inevitable, but each is but a step towards final victory. For better or for worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/9022fc67984f2231bc9d79412f5e7f72.avif?t=1755639092\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark and opressive atmosphere,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Timed-Turn Combat System - Make all your moves in time, or lose your chance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multi-stage boss battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Macabre monster design,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Resource Management,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seamless world - Entering buildings does not transfer you to different location,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple endings,</p>",
